Package: commensurability.cross.study
Type: Compendium
Title: Commensurability and Cross-Study Inference in Quantitative Species Interaction Networks
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Chris", "Brimacombe", email = "cbrimaco@uoguelph.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Code and data used to reproduce the analyses of the study
    "Commensurability and cross-study inference in quantitative species
    interaction networks". This file is not a real R package; it lists the R
    packages required by the scripts in R/ so that dependencies can be
    easily installed.
